#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
EternaFX Framework – Fully Integrated Prototype

This prototype combines multiple advanced modules:
  • Quantum Computing & Entanglement (simulated via Qiskit placeholders)
  • Optimization Algorithms (DART optimizer for asset rebalancing)
  • Mathematical Models (Golden Ratio scaling, P vs NP estimates, Yang-Mills field, Riemann Zeta approximation)
  • Societal Success Equation for SSA Applications:
         H(x,t) = [R_d(t) * H_e(t)] - C_m(t)
  • Adaptive 2D Navier–Stokes simulation with turbulence control
  • Chat Automation via a simulated GPT interface for natural language command processing
  • Real-time Visualization (using matplotlib for demonstration)

Security and compliance (AES-256, MFA, RBAC) are assumed to be implemented in production.

Dependencies: numpy, matplotlib, openai, qiskit, scipy
"""

import numpy as np
